<title>NETHERLANDS: DSM to invest DFl 70 mln in Spanish site.</title>
<headline>DSM to invest DFl 70 mln in Spanish site.</headline>
<dateline>HEERLEN, Netherlands 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch chemicals group DSM NV said on Friday it was investing 70 million guilders in a Spanish site for the production of antibiotics.  </p>
<p>DSM said DSM Fine Chemicals BV would invest around 70 million guilders in its location in its DSM Deretil business unit in Almeria, Spain.</p>
<p>DSM Deretil, formed on January 1 1997, is one of the five business units of DSM Fine Chemicals.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
